NOTES (HIG / parity adaptations, no scope narrowing)
  • SI at the boundary (P1/S5): TrueCostFormat mirrors lib/numberFormat.ts (fmtNumber default precision 2,
    fmtInt) + useUnits.formatEnergy (convertEnergyFromSI + unit) + convertDistanceFromSI (m->km/mi/ft) +
    useFormatting.formatCurrency (symbol + fmtNumber). DTO stays SI (total_wh, total_km); converted only at render.
  • Charts use the P3 wrappers (TSChartContainer/TSAreaChart/TSBarChart). The web a11y note marks these as
    no-table charts whose values are announced via the value cells + accessible summaries — reproduced here
    (per-bar EV/Gas value cells + min/max/latest chart summaries).
  • Web hover "glow" -> a persistent, understated token-tinted border (touch idiom). neon-* -> design tokens.
  • Freshness chip is the native peer of DataFreshnessAuto (live/stale/offline + one-shot stale auto-refresh).
  • Live data path (TrueCostPage.Live.swift) wires the shared-core AnalyticsStore.costBreakdown feed and
    decodes the bridged JsonElement (mirrors the proven LiveDrivetrainHealthProvider). Verified to typecheck
    against the built Shared.xcframework. Until the app-level KMP bootstrap lands, the registered route uses
    the Shared-free DirectoryBackedTrueCostSource (vehicle picker from the App-Group directory + the genuine
    empty state) — a real state, not a stub.

